      "content": "it’s just that everyone keeps saying \"it wasn't your fault\" but it feels like it was. i spent years of my life basically living in that hospital room and he still left. i've given everything i have and i'm just empty. like there's nothing left of me to keep going. everything just feels so heavy and pointless now.",
